        "created_at": "2013-04-30T13:45:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What a lot of us on the forums have been doing is allowing a specific damage source to be redirected once per redirection effect. Basically, that one instance of damage can only funnel through smoke bombs once per turn.</p><p>Good question. This has been debated at length multiple times. You are not the only one curious about this</p>",
