        "created_at": "2013-04-30T17:49:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I thought that in past discussions we'd reached the conclusion that no ruling was necessary, that general consensus is that each card that redirects can only be applied once.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If anyone wants to make the case that this needs a ruling, please let me know. I will ask, however, that if you do so you look through what has already been discussed on the forums. Unfortunately, I do not have pointers for you to past topics.</p>",
